&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Senior Information Security Analyst - Customer Trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:Bangalore (Hybrid, 3 days a week)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Information Security organization advances the overall state of security at Rubrik through&amp;nbsp;critical initiatives and coordination of large security projects. Information Security builds&amp;nbsp;technologies, tools, and processes to better enable teams at Rubrik to develop secure software&amp;nbsp;and protect data and systems with appropriate security controls. Information Security also&amp;nbsp;develops systems to monitor and respond to attacks against our assets, provides awareness&amp;nbsp;education to teams on security best practices for data protection, and ensures data governance&amp;nbsp;and data sharing relationships with third parties in order to securely protect Rubrik information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is seeking a Senior Information Security Analyst to support and oversee activities within&amp;nbsp;the Customer Trust function at our Bangalore, India office. As a member of the Customer Trust&amp;nbsp;team, you will be a highly motivated professional responsible for executing key service areas&amp;nbsp;and driving their continuous improvement and maturity. The successful candidate will build and&amp;nbsp;maintain strong cross-functional relationships across the organization while demonstrating&amp;nbsp;exceptional interpersonal skills and the ability to confidently lead customer-facing discussions&amp;nbsp;and engagements. This role requires strong leadership, communication, collaboration, and&amp;nbsp;decision-making skills, along with the ability to work effectively across multiple stakeholders&amp;nbsp;and priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated individual that wants to be a part of a front-line customer&amp;nbsp;facing function of security within Rubrik that helps sales close revenue opportunities by sharing&amp;nbsp;Rubrik’s security posture with customers. Key responsibilities include sharing Rubrik&#39;s security&amp;nbsp;posture with customers by interacting with key security stakeholders in the customers&amp;nbsp;organization, responding to customer RFPs, redlining security terms in customer contracts,&amp;nbsp;facilitating customer audits and other customer requests that are related to Rubrik&#39;s enterprise&amp;nbsp;or product security and compliance capabilities. In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to security and compliance portions of customer RFPs in an accurate and timely fashion (i.e., within agreed upon internal SLAs), leveraging AI generated responses and validating responses..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and collaborate with other Information Security, Product security and Engineering SMEs, as needed to respond to customers and drive security posture outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build narratives and perform security reviews of new products to ensure there are accurate responses for RFPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support security and compliance related customer audits, as requested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be well-versed in Rubrik&#39;s products, particularly as they pertain to security and compliance features and secure SDLC practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Sales Operations, Field Operations, Sales, Sales Engineering, Marketing, and Engineering teams to intake requests and drive improvements to the customer trust process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute operational activities related to the maturity and measurement of the customer trust process to provide high quality services that enable sales at Rubrik.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the maturity of the customer facing collateral that disseminates security and compliance related announcements and thought leadership to new customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the finalisation of security and compliance language in customer contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be well versed with industry leading frameworks such as DORA, ISO 27001, SOC 2, PCI,DSS, HIPAA and HITRUST&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of related work experience in Customer Trust &amp;amp; Security Assurance in the tech industry, preferably in the cyber resilience space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the cyber security practice at a Big 4 audit firm (Deloitte, PwC, EY, or KPMG) is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have driven several security and/or operational Information security processes within a company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing and negotiating contracts as it relates to security and compliance obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to meet demanding timelines and SLAs, manage changing priorities and execute tasks with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of common security risks, vulnerabilities, and threats and can translate these issues through triage / risk treatment conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of information security frameworks and compliance requirements, such as DORA, ISO 27001/2 (including ISO 27017 &amp;amp; 18), FedRAMP, SOC 2 Trust Services Criteria, CIS Top 20, PCI DSS, HIPAA, and NIST CSF / 800-53.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented and able to understand the bigger picture by using your technical expertise and problem solving abilities to prioritize and manage blocking issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to discuss issues at technical and business levels with audiences of various backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Security, Computer Science, Management Information Systems or related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
