&lt;li&gt;Perform Performance testing and articulate deep dive architectural understanding of the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform new product testing with a focus on delivering accurate, timely, unbiased analysis as a subject matter expert&lt;/li&gt;
