&lt;li&gt;Work with the engineering, product management and product marketing team to put together collaterals helpful for demand generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
