&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;9uojk&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;engbv-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;engbv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;engbv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;engbv-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; — Simplifies financial complexity for non-finance stakeholders at all levels. Comfortable working across global teams and time zones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;9uojk&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Detail Orientation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;— Delivers &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r14:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;accurate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, high-quality work consistently in a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r16:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;fast-paced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;euqjl-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AP &amp;amp; Expenses Projects Analyst will play a key role in driving operational excellence, automation, and project coordination within our Accounts Payable and Employee Expense Management functions. This role sits at the intersection of finance operations and technology, focusing on streamlining processes, identifying efficiency gaps, supporting automation initiatives, and collaborating with cross-functional and global teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify process inefficiencies, operational gaps, and bottlenecks across AP and expense management workflows; recommend and support end-to-end continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Coordination &amp;amp; Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support project delivery life cycles, track milestones, gather and articulate business requirements, write process documentation (SOPs), and manage task tracking via platforms such as Jira and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate User Acceptance Testing (UAT), author detailed test scenarios/cases, facilitate testing cycles with operational teams, and track defect resolution through go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Business Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Extract, manipulate, and analyze finance data to develop reporting models, monitor key performance indicators (KPIs), and present actionable operational insights to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Global Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with regional finance operations, procurement, IT, and global business partners to align project deliverables and maintain financial controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Commerce, Accounting, Finance, Business Administration, Information Systems, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 to 3.5 years of professional experience in Accounts Payable, Finance Operations, Process Improvement, Automation, or Project Coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid foundational understanding of Accounts Payable and Employee Expense Management processes, including invoice processing, payment runs, expense audits, reconciliations, and internal financial controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytical Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel and Google Sheets (advanced formulas, pivot tables, data modeling, dashboards).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodologies &amp;amp; Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven familiarity with project tracking and documentation tools such as Jira and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong problem-solving abilities, high analytical acumen, excellent verbal/written communication, and capacity to handle multiple priorities in a globally distributed setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And extra credit if you have experience in any of the following&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience or exposure to ERP, Procure-to-Pay (P2P), and expense platforms such as Coupa, NetSuite, SAP, or Oracle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing dashboards and visualizations using Business Intelligence tools like Tableau, Microsoft Power BI, or Google Workspace tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on scripting and automation capability utilizing Google Apps Script, Python, VBA, or RPA technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with emerging technologies, including Generative AI, AI-driven automation, Optical Character Recognition (OCR), and Intelligent Document Processing (IDP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI_Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI_P17884_3364916&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta&#39;s Silver customers across ASEAN, India, Korea and Hong Kong carry real renewal ARR and our best Silver-to-Gold pipeline, but there are too many of them for 1:1 coverage. As a Digital CSM on the Asia Silver team, you will turn Gainsight, Salesforce and usage signals into prioritised, repeatable motions that protect renewals, get customers to value faster, and surface qualified expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t hold a fixed book of relationships. You will own the system that decides which Silver customers get which touch, and you&#39;ll measure whether it works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you like building scalable motions that change customer outcomes, and you care about results more than send volume, this is your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the signal-to-action loop.&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor renewal forecasts, Gainsight risk and CTAs, activation data and account context. Segment the Silver book into worst-case renewals, flat with churn risk, and flat with growth potential, and route each to the right motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect the base.&lt;/strong&gt; Prioritise the worst-case renewals [window to validate, e.g. 3 quarters out]. Trigger and track risk playbooks with named owners, and run targeted saves and Path-to-Green plans, escalating to AEs, Renewal Managers, Support or CSM leadership when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve adoption.&lt;/strong&gt; Close post-sale activation gaps by driving the core value features (FastPass, Workflows, LCM, OIG, Device Assurance) through activation CTAs, onboarding programs and digital nudges. Help customers reach first value inside [90] days, and connect each feature to a business outcome the customer can point to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify expansion.&lt;/strong&gt; Qualify mature, growth-ready accounts through 1:many outreach and partner cohorts. Support AEs in identifying growth opportunities with smaller tactical activities such as Lead Pass or adoption assessments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run programs.&lt;/strong&gt; Design multi-channel outreach (email sequences, webinars and cohort sessions, community and partner-enabled campaigns). Test and iterate on messaging, and build and maintain self-service assets. Flag gaps where assets don&#39;t exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI as part of the job.&lt;/strong&gt; Use tools like Claude, Gemini and NotebookLM to synthesise account context, generate customer-ready content and automate your own workflows. We expect practical fluency, not familiarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and report.&lt;/strong&gt; Report on revenue protected, churn risk reduced, activation speed, qualified expansion and Silver-to-Gold conversion, so leadership can see which programs move outcomes and which don&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the voice of the Silver customer.&lt;/strong&gt; Surface patterns from the book to product, marketing and CS leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across the field.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with AEs, SEs, Renewal Managers, Support and partners to get the best outcome for each account without friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT WE&#39;RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in customer success, digital or scale CS, lifecycle marketing or customer marketing, ideally in SaaS or security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of running 1:many programs with measured outcomes (activation, renewal, pipeline), not just campaign activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Gainsight (or similar) and Salesforce, including building segments, triggers and dashboards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated AI fluency, shown through real deliverables, workflows or scalable motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to read risk and adoption data and turn it into a clear next action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident writing for customers across diverse APJ markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort holding a renewal-risk conversation and escalating to the right owner, even when you don&#39;t hold the commercial relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of identity and access concepts, or the curiosity to build it quickly. Okta Professional and Administrator certifications are expected within your first 90 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset: you raise your own bar and find the faster path, you&#39;re energised by ambiguity, and you want outcomes over activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree preferred or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P21259_3609947&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Okta is looking for a Benefits Operations Specialist to support in shaping the employee experience globally by administering thoughtful, business-critical and people-focused programs. You will be a key member of the People Operations team focused on delivering an exceptional employee experience across the People Operations &amp;amp; Benefits teams. The ideal candidate will be a self-starter with great customer service skills and broad knowledge of global employee benefits programs &amp;amp; processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People Operations Specialist (Benefits) job description:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First line support in response to employee requests and queries on policies, processes, resources, etc. - triage, prioritize, and escalate as appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support leave of absence (LOA), and other time away inquiries/requests and provide administrative LOA support to the global benefits team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administering benefits, leave of absence (LOA), and workers’ compensation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting benefits plan information to upper management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing information to explain changes in benefits to employees and answering employee queries about benefits policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong service orientation, and an ability to establish and maintain effective working relationships with users, peers, office and firm management, and outside business partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills, including effective documentation and management of benefits operations processes and workflows. Ensure consistent and timely upkeep of knowledge content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in training, review and improvement of new tasks/processes transitioned to People Operations as we expand the Shared Services support globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for ad-hoc requests, tasks and projects as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline and simplify our benefits processes to drive efficiency and operational success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support benefits process for employee lifecycle (hire to retire) in the US &amp;amp; globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support benefits statutory program and compliance execution (i.e. HCSF, benefits-in-kind reporting and audits, COBRA subsidy administration, processing pension forms, and others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor file integration, perform testing as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefits program invoices audit and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the benefits team to understand upcoming policy and program changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with maintenance and updates for benefits-related content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support benefits audits as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Knowledge &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 5 years experience in benefits operations, benefits administration, global employee benefits, and/or leave management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English- speaking, writing, and reading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working in Workday &amp;amp; ServiceNow is highly desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-speed, global technology company preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work cross-functionally, take initiative and meet multiple deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outstanding customer service, verbal, and written communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent critical thinking and organizational skills with attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient experience in Google Suite and must gravitate easily to new technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and adjust to changing priorities and deadlines in a professional and positive manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to apply learnings from previous experiences to future opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage sensitive and confidential information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and propose process improvement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA shift (2pm to 11pm IST)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
