&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Operations Specialist - Payroll &amp;amp; Compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a People Operations Specialist, you’ll play a critical role in executing our Shared Services processes and programs supporting the Okta Compensation Team across regions. You will be covering our Global Compensation and Global Payroll landscape including but not limited to employee inquiries, annual programs, recognition programs, onboarding, audits and reporting.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your role, you will be exposed to, and have the ability to support in shaping the employee experience globally by administering thoughtful, business-critical and people-focused programs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First line support in response to employee requests and queries on policies, processes, resources, etc. - triage, prioritize, and escalate as appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and audit the Workday entries ensuring accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support building Compensation and Payroll content and administrating knowledge articles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support One Time Payment and Recognition programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hires’ onboarding audit to ensure the process is completed timely for payroll processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support international transfer audit engaging with the employees including zoom calls, resources and advise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the LATAM inquiries. - Vacations, medical coverage, payslips, payroll calendar, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in training, review and improvement of new tasks/processes transitioned to People Operations as we expand the Shared Services support globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for ad-hoc requests, tasks and projects as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply learnings from previous experiences to future opportunities, continuously seeking ways to improve processes and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-growth organisation, with the ability to thrive in a fast-paced and dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate sound judgement and discretion when handling sensitive and confidential information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage high volumes of cases while effectively prioritising competing tasks and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify process gaps and recommend opportunities for continuous improvement and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong administrative, organisational, and problem-solving skills, with excellent attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable to changing business requirements, priorities, and evolving processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player with the ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams and stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 to 3 years of experience supporting the Payroll Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work shift in PST time (9pm to 5pm IST )&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Workday and ServiceNow, or another ticketing system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Google and Microsoft Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Compensation or Total Rewards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred experience in the employee lifecycle (onboarding, benefits, leaves, etc)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred experience with AI tools (Gemini, NotebookLM, Clause, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
