&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 4 years relevant experience writing documentation for Cloud or Enterprise products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or certificate in Technical Writing is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who thrives in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing SDK, CLI, or developer tools documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing developer documentation and release notes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Markdown, Visual Studio Code, Acrolinx, and source code control tools such as Git and GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity working with Jira and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good collaboration skills with the writers and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
