&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to understand the application of security products in the real world and produce use case-based content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Okta or similar identity and access management solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DITA, OpenAPI, and any API management and publishing platform.&lt;/li&gt;
