&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Understanding of the HR/ERP platform is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
