&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0&quot;&gt;From redesigning customer experiences with Modern Data platforms and services to evolving internal tools and workflows, we are making deliberate investments to innovate in critical areas and outdistance competitors. Everpure is looking for Software Engineers to act as pure individual contributors driving this digital transformation. In this role, you will collaborate directly with Architects, Engineering Leaders, and Customer Escalation Engineers on new requirements, roadmap development, and complex escalations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2&quot;&gt;. You will gain a deep understanding of block storage, asynchronous and synchronous replication, and disaster recovery while building new products from scratch and working extensively within the Kubernetes storage ecosystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
