&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Handling multiple live production environments and resolving complex customer issues within large distributed systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Working collaboratively with peers, Architects, and Engineering Leaders, while successfully juggling parallel tasks based on priority.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analyzing and solving challenging problems through persistence, working independently with minimal supervision.&lt;/div&gt;
