&lt;p&gt;Join the team pioneering enterprise storage technology by building Pure’s proprietary Direct Flash Module (DFM)—the core innovation that gives FlashArray and FlashBlade an unbeatable edge over off-the-shelf SSDs. You will work across the entire data path, NAND media management, and low-level hardware interfaces to integrate cutting-edge QLC NAND, NVMe/PCIe, and custom controllers. In close partnership with hardware, Purity software, and drive qualification teams, you will directly influence how world-changing companies interact with their data at massive scale.&lt;/p&gt;
