&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive Core Firmware Innovation: Design, implement, and test low-level embedded C/C++ firmware features and custom NAND media management algorithms that directly maximize storage performance, density, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Enable Next-Gen Hardware: Lead bring-up and integration efforts for state-of-the-art NAND media, microcontrollers, and SoC hardware components, ensuring rapid adoption of emerging media technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Elevate Quality &amp;amp; Simulation Tools: Build advanced firmware simulation environments, failure analysis processes, and Python-based automation frameworks (CI, unit, and regression testing) to shorten development feedback loops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Deliver Cross-Functional Impact: Partner end-to-end with hardware, system software, and manufacturing teams to deliver fully integrated, high-availability storage modules from concept through release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
