&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_84d0d10126900d7b-21&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
