&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Observability &amp;amp; Systems Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Instrument end-to-end frontend and backend telemetry to continuously improve time-to-insight, API latency, and UI performance while directly operating services in production.&lt;/p&gt;
