&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Cross-Stack Triage &amp;amp; Root-Cause Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive end-to-end debugging of complex failures across platform logs, Linux OS behavior, and device firmware alongside hardware and firmware teams, turning actionable diagnostics into permanent system-wide improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
