&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strengthen Observability &amp;amp; Operational Safety Rails:&lt;/strong&gt; Enhance automation, telemetry, and automated safeguards for firmware and drive management to prevent regressions and ensure production readiness from initial hardware samples to global deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
