&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Full-Stack Debugging &amp;amp; Triage Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to isolate and resolve complex failures spanning application/platform logs, Linux command-line/OS internals, and underlying hardware or device firmware.&lt;/p&gt;
