&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear, structured written and verbal communication skills to synthesize complex failure patterns, align firmware and hardware stakeholders, and drive data-backed engineering decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
