&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build enterprise tool integrations and secure data access:&lt;/strong&gt; Create secure, least-privilege Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools across core systems (ERP, CRM, ticketing) and implement grounded retrieval architectures and read-only query layers on Snowflake to deliver trusted operational insights.&lt;/p&gt;
