&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deliver enterprise-grade user interfaces and approval portals:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop performant Next.js portals, administrative consoles, and human-in-the-loop review interfaces to enable business teams to validate outputs and maintain strict governance seamlessly.&lt;/p&gt;
