&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive operational reliability and collaborative technical excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor platform accuracy, drift, latency, and cost using observability tools like Datadog and Langfuse, while guiding vendor and in-house engineers through rigorous code reviews, architecture specs, and on-call ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
