&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Production-proven agentic AI and distributed systems expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep hands-on experience designing, shipping, and running complex multi-agent architectures and LLM applications in production, with mastery of Python, TypeScript, SQL, LangGraph, and cloud ecosystems such as AWS (Bedrock, AgentCore, Lambda, ECS).&lt;/p&gt;
