&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enterprise data integration and architectural rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated proficiency developing secure tools and APIs using Model Context Protocol (MCP), designing grounded retrieval/RAG pipelines over enterprise data platforms (such as Snowflake), and managing fine-grained authorization and data security.&lt;/p&gt;
