&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Safety, governance, and evaluation ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven capability implementing enterprise security controls, comprehensive audit logging, human-in-the-loop verification, and continuous automated evaluation frameworks to manage latency, cost, and accuracy trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
