&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-functional leadership and technical communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to translate complex financial and business processes into clear system specifications, evaluate technical trade-offs effectively, and guide cross-functional contributors through architectural reviews and mentorship.&lt;/p&gt;
