&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a senior analyst who builds. Not someone who specs a dashboard and hands it to a BI&amp;nbsp;developer — someone who takes an ambiguous business question, models the data behind it, designs the&amp;nbsp;interface, ships it as a working web application, and then sits with the stakeholder who uses it.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll work across the business — People, Finance, Products, and other lines of business — building custom,&amp;nbsp;web-based analytics products that people actually open on a Monday morning. You&#39;ll use AI and GenAI tools (including Claude) to move from idea to deployed prototype in days rather than quarters, without the&amp;nbsp;constraints of traditional BI platforms.&amp;nbsp;This is a hands-on individual contributor role. You will spend your time in SQL, in data models, in code, and in&amp;nbsp;front of the people who depend on what you build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own analytics products end to end&lt;/strong&gt;. Gather requirements directly from business stakeholders, model the underlying data, build the dashboard, validate it, deploy it, and iterate on real usage independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and ship custom web-based dashboards&lt;/strong&gt;. Build intelligent, self-serve analytics experiences as real web applications, using AI and GenAI tools to rapidly prototype and implement solutions that off-the- shelf BI tools can&#39;t deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make the data trustworthy&lt;/strong&gt;. Build clean, well-documented data models in SQL. Partner with data engineering and platform engineering so what you ship is scalable, reliable, and audit-ready in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for the reader, not the data&lt;/strong&gt;. Decide what belongs on the screen and what doesn&#39;t. Make hierarchy, layout, and chart choice do real work, so an executive gets the answer in five seconds and an analyst can still drill to the detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn findings into decisions&lt;/strong&gt;. Translate complex analysis into a clear narrative for senior leadership — making the story behind the numbers as rigorous as the numbers themselves — and follow through until the insight changes something.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype where AI helps.&lt;/strong&gt; Explore and deploy AI-powered analytics capabilities — natural-language querying, automated narrative, anomaly surfacing — where they make a product genuinely more useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become the domain expert.&lt;/strong&gt; Learn the business processes behind the numbers deeply enough that your outputs are grounded in real strategy, not just in what data happens to exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the {{OFFICE_LOCATION}} office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in an analytics function, with a track record of taking complex projects from ambiguous problem to shipped, adopted outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and data modelling. You&#39;re comfortable at both the strategic and the query level — designing a semantic layer one day, debugging a window function the next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and deploy web-based analytics applications. You&#39;ve shipped dashboards as real web apps, not just BI workbooks. Comfortable with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, or with frameworks such as React, Streamlit, Dash, or Plotly — and with using AI coding tools to get from prototype to production quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine visual design sense. You know why one chart lands and another doesn&#39;t. You sweat layout, spacing, color, and information hierarchy, and you can point to work that proves it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-sufficiency. You can run the full lifecycle alone: stakeholder conversation → data model → built dashboard → deployed and adopted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication. You can hold a room of senior leaders, defend your numbers, and influence decisions without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
