&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Cross-Functional Alignment &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Unify Engineering, QA, Hardware, and Architecture teams through crisp decision frameworks, balancing customer value, technical debt, release velocity, and risk mitigation from concept to GA.&lt;/p&gt;
