&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Pure Storage is seeking a Sourcing Manager to join our Corporate Sourcing &amp;amp; Procurement team. In this role, you will develop and execute strategic sourcing initiatives that optimize supplier performance, reduce costs, and strengthen overall supply chain resilience. Partnering closely with key business units—including HR, Legal, Operations, and Finance—you will align sourcing strategies with corporate objectives to maximize value and streamline spend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;This is an in-office role based out of our Bangalore office, requiring daily onsite attendance in accordance with Pure Storage’s workplace policies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
