&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Strategic Supplier Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary liaison for key global suppliers, driving continuous value through executive engagements, joint business planning, performance reviews, and proactive risk mitigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect Category Strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute multi-year sourcing plans across complex spend categories that scale with business growth and elevate supplier capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Govern Preferred Supplier Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Expand and refine governance frameworks, driving supplier accountability through clear performance KPIs, compliance mechanisms, and organization-wide adoption of sourcing best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Commercial Negotiations:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead end-to-end commercial negotiations and contract lifecycle management to secure favorable terms, mitigate legal and financial risks, and unlock long-term value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deliver Data-Driven Sourcing Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage spend analytics and performance metrics to assess supplier health, uncover new savings opportunities, and guide executive reporting and sourcing roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
