&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive High-Stakes Escalation Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end ownership of critical, multi-platform system issues—evaluating hardware, software, networking, and environmental factors—to rapidly restore service, perform root-cause analysis, and protect customer business continuity.&lt;/div&gt;
