&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Elevate Engineering Talent &amp;amp; Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor and coach support team members through joint case triage, structured technical trainings, and internal documentation, accelerating technical capabilities and resolution velocity across the organization.&lt;/div&gt;
