&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;End-to-end technical troubleshooting and root-cause analysis expertise across multi-vendor environments, including Linux/Windows administration, cloud architectures (AWS), REST API services, virtualization (VMware, Hyper-V), and enterprise storage protocols (NFS, S3, SMB).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
