&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;In-depth understanding of enterprise networking and systems architecture, with hands-on proficiency in core protocols (DNS, HTTP, SSL, TCP/IP) and diagnosing complex networking, replication, performance, and capacity issues.&lt;/div&gt;
