&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Join Everpure’s AI Factory as a founding technical lead driving the Office of the CFO’s mission to transform Global Finance into an insight-driven strategic partner. In this high-impact, hands-on role, you will pioneer production-grade autonomous agent systems and enterprise platform components that unlock automated financial workflows at scale. You will collaborate directly with finance leaders, internal software teams, and external engineering partners, establishing technical direction while shipping clean, auditable code daily.&lt;/p&gt;
