&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications: &lt;/strong&gt;Relevant industry certifications such as GCIH, GCIA, AWS Certified Security - Specialty, or CKS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attack Surface Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in secret hygiene management, identity attack surface monitoring, and managing Shadow AI risk.&lt;/li&gt;
