&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep Workday Core HCM &amp;amp; Time/Absence Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery in designing, configuring, and maintaining complex Workday environments, with focused expertise in time tracking, absence plans, eligibility rules, business process frameworks, and calculated fields.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;HR Ecosystem &amp;amp; Agile Tools Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage multi-system workflows and integrations within an Agile framework, leveraging platforms like ServiceNow HRSD for case management and SLAs alongside Jira and Confluence for technical tracking.&lt;/p&gt;
