&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a passion and excitement for building a career in technical recruiting;&amp;nbsp; expertise in passive candidate sourcing for either technical or sales-focused roles is preferred but not required. Previous experience in a technology-focused organization is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Showcase a strong knowledge of robust sourcing tactics and best practices to identify a broad top-of-funnel pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain creative and out-of-the-box sourcing techniques to tap into new pools of talent, while uncovering new tactics through research and knowledge-sharing with peers&lt;/li&gt;
