&lt;p&gt;Join MongoDB’s Early Talent team and help build our pipeline of interns and graduate hires in India. You’ll lead full-cycle recruiting across multiple business units, develop relationships with universities and student communities, and partner with hiring managers to bring strong early career talent to MongoDB.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a chance to shape how we engage and hire students in India while working within the global Early Talent team. You’ll balance regional campus needs with shared recruiting practices and use candidate and pipeline insights to continually improve the hiring experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Gurugram for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
