&lt;li&gt;Represent MongoDB at university events and recruiting activities, helping students understand our opportunities and strengthening our presence on campus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers to define role requirements, agree on recruiting plans, assess candidates, share pipeline updates, and make timely hiring decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a clear, thoughtful candidate experience through timely communication and consistent support from first outreach through offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Program Coordination team on candidate experience, recruiting operations, and intern and new graduate onboarding and programming Coordinate closely on event and interview logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use recruiting data and market feedback to monitor pipeline health, identify bottlenecks, and improve recruiting strategies and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the growth of MongoDB’s early talent programs in India, sharing regional insights and partnering with global teammates to improve how we attract and hire early career talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience, including at least 2 years in early talent, university, or campus recruiting, or a closely related function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting in a fast paced, high volume environment and managing multiple roles or hiring priorities at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship building skills and experience partnering with hiring managers, candidates, and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data informed approach to recruiting, with the ability to use pipeline insights to guide decisions and improve outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization, prioritization, and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working collaboratively with a global, cross functional team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with an applicant tracking system; Greenhouse experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Google Workspace is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel and work nonstandard hours as needed for campus recruiting activities and global collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About MongoDB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is built for change, empowering our customers and our people to innovate at the speed of the market. We have redefined the data platform for the AI era, enabling builders to create, transform, and disrupt industries with software. MongoDB’s unified data platform, the most widely available, globally distributed data platform on the market, helps organizations modernize legacy workloads, embrace innovation, and unleash AI. Our cloud-native platform, MongoDB Atlas, is the only globally distributed, multi-cloud data platform and is available across AWS, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
