&lt;h3&gt;Team Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB seeks an experienced Senior Software Engineer to join Enterprise Architecture on a focused team dedicated to AI experimentation. You&#39;ll partner with teams across the organization, including Internal Engineering, to explore, prototype, and validate emerging AI capabilities before they become formal roadmap priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
