&lt;li&gt;Track record in hiring, mentoring, and growing high-performing software engineering teams, experience working with remote teams and a passion for mentoring and career development of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written technical communication skills and desire to collaborate with colleagues, other teams, and lead projects&lt;/li&gt;
