&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is seeking a Senior Manager, Accounting to join the Corporate Accounting team within Controllership in Gurugram. This role will lead core corporate accounting activities, global close execution, balance-sheet integrity, reconciliations, accounting operations, and process improvement across MongoDB’s multi-entity environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager will partner closely with General Ledger, SEC Reporting, Technical Accounting, FP&amp;amp;A, Legal, Tax, Internal Audit, and external auditors. The role is designed for an accounting leader who can combine strong operational judgment with disciplined execution, clear communication, and a process-improvement mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Corporate accounting and global close&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and review corporate accounting activities across the monthly, quarterly, and annual close cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quality and timeliness of balance-sheet reconciliations, journal entries, account analyses, flux explanations, and other close deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with global accounting teams to resolve variances, strengthen close procedures, and maintain consistent accounting practices across entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support consolidation activities, intercompany accounting, accruals, prepaids, fixed assets, leases, and other corporate accounting areas as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with SEC Reporting and Technical Accounting to provide accurate close data, schedules, and supporting documentation for external reporting and accounting conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Controls, audit, and process improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and strengthen accounting controls and support SOX activities, including control execution, evidence quality, process narratives, and remediation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key point of contact for internal and external auditors during walkthroughs, quarterly reviews, annual audits, and requests related to corporate accounting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve data quality, reduce manual effort, and increase automation across close and reconciliation processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help implement scalable accounting policies, procedures, and documentation as MongoDB continues to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership and partnership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop accounting professionals while setting clear expectations for quality, accountability, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate work across global accounting teams and help establish consistent processes across entities and reporting cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate accounting issues into clear, practical guidance for Finance leadership and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships across the organization and represent Controllership with sound judgment and a service-oriented approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of progressive accounting experience, including significant experience in corporate accounting, global close, or a related controllership function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of U.S. GAAP and corporate accounting processes in a public-company or similarly complex environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multi-entity accounting, consolidations, intercompany activity, balance-sheet reconciliations, and close management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a SOX-controlled environment and partnering with internal and external auditors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, mentoring, or managing accounting professionals in a global organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, organizational, written, and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities, operate effectively during close and reporting cycles, and make sound decisions with incomplete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NetSuite, FloQast, Workiva, or similar accounting and reporting systems is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
