&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, test, and release features for&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/products/ops-manager&quot;&gt; Ops Manager&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end delivery of complex projects, from design through incremental shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve issues surfaced in customer deployments running at scale&lt;/li&gt;
