&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to use conversational AI systems (like Claude, ChatGPT, and internal chatbots) to support researching, authoring, reviewing, and synthesizing various SDLC artifacts such as TDDs, PRDs, Postmortems, Test Plans, and Proposals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
