&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join the Future of Security at Netskope&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Netskope (NASDAQ: NTSK) is a leader in modern security and networking for the cloud and AI era. We secure and accelerate cloud, data, and AI in real time, everywhere. Thousands of customers, including more than 30 of the Fortune 100, trust the Netskope One platform, its Zero Trust Engine, and the powerful NewEdge network to gain full visibility and control without performance trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Netskope, our technology is driven by our greatest strength: our people. We believe that belonging powers innovation, and success is both personal and organizational. We embrace differences in gender, ethnicity, beliefs, ability, and identity, creating an environment where every voice is heard and respected. We empower our employees to bring their authentic selves to work, grow their careers through continuous education and mentorship, and lead with transparency and curiosity. Join a team where you belong, where you are encouraged to be an entrepreneur, and where together, we continue to redefine the landscape of security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.netskope.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Careers at Netskope&lt;/a&gt; to learn more. Follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/netskope&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/netskope/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note, this team is hiring across all levels and candidates are individually assessed and appropriately leveled based upon their skills and experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Netskope Product Managers use their passion for AI security to bridge customer business requirements with key market trends, and deliver world-class products to market. You will work closely with customers and prospects to present our solutions and understand their requirements, and you will partner with engineering, marketing and the field to define the product roadmap, launch the product and develop an effective GTM plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a talented Principal Product Manager who is passionate about creating a seamless experience for the enterprises as they adopt Netskope Skylight AI Security Platform. In this role you will lead the strategy and development of AI Agent security for AI applications and agents running locally, detect risky or anomalous behavior (such as prompt injection, data leakage, and unsanctioned tool use), and enable security teams to respond in real time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with engineering, research, and customer-facing teams to secure risky agent actions on end user devices and agent platforms with well-defined security requirements, and shape the roadmap as AI agents become a core part of how employees work. Ideal candidates bring 10+ years of product management experience (including endpoint security), a deep understanding of how AI models, agents, and tool-calling protocols such as MCP work, and a track record of influencing without authority and explaining technical risk to both practitioners and executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the product owner, you will define strategy, drive execution and collaborate with engineering, research and go to market teams to bring AI agent security to enterprise environments and security workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for driving the vision, strategy, execution and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating customer business needs into product strategy and technology requirements as part of MRD and PRD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing, managing and communicating the product roadmap to both internal and external key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership of working with the broader team to ensure high-quality deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring optimal user experiences for end users by working closely with UX/UI designer and development teams on workflows, look-and-feel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing compelling sales tools and marketing content to support sales and field marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating financial, market, and other analytical models to guide product pricing and go-to-market decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining competitive matrix and competitive intelligence materials including hands-on product testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traveling up to 25% (2x year to USA, customer meetings, trade shows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of specialized experience&lt;/strong&gt; in endpoint security or related cybersecurity markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record&lt;/strong&gt; of successfully delivering SaaS or cloud-native security products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt; working with AI/ML solutions, including collaborating with technical AI/ML engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
