&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Browser team is at the forefront of developing the Netskope Enterprise Browser, a critical tool designed to direct corporate traffic securely within our network. This browser integrates advanced features that enhance both security and productivity in a corporate environment. Leveraging our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.netskope.com/products/next-gen-swg&quot;&gt; Next Gen Secure Web Gateway (SWG)&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.netskope.com/products/security-service-edge&quot;&gt; Security Service Edge (SSE)&lt;/a&gt; solutions, we bring these powerful capabilities directly to the browser, ensuring a seamless, secure, and controlled browsing experience—all within a single cloud platform. Safe sites are allowed, malicious sites are blocked, and user actions are carefully managed.&lt;/p&gt;
