&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is a global provider of enterprise platform for marketers. Our platforms help Marketers reach 1.56 billion unique users through mobile to help them engage, acquire, re-engage, re-market and retain valuable users. InMobi is also India’s first unicorn and one of the only profitable global tech-product companies to emerge out of India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;At 20+ offices across the globe, InMobi employs over 1000 personnel constituting 25 nationalities. Acclaimed for its culture, InMobi has consecutively featured on the Great Places to Work (GPTW) list, with a consistent hold in the Top 50 position for the past two years. Moreover, these accolades are not just restricted to India, InMobi has also secured a ranking on the GPTW’s 2017 China List, a notable feat for an Indian startup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi has also regularly featured on world disruptor lists&lt;strong&gt; – &lt;/strong&gt;MIT Technology Review’s 2013 50 Disruptive Companies; Fast Company’s Most Innovative Companies for 2016, 2018; CNBC’s Disruptor 50 list of 2018, here InMobi was selected amongst a pool of more than 980 forward-thinking and ambitiou private companies across the globe, we now share this space with the likes of SpaceX, Airbnb, Uber and so on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the InMobi family like? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an infectious bunch. Be it the way we rise to challenges, the innovative products we create, the dreams we chase or the fun we have at work. We are sure that if you meet us, you will be infected too. Today, we are proud to be the leaders in Mobile advertising and are on an accelerated path of being a leader in enterprise software for marketers. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion. We are here today because a few of us did just that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we promise? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer you an opportunity to work on building enterprise platforms that require you to acquire, hone and demonstrate your engineering skills in designing and solving for complex problems, thereby creating software that creates value for our customers in a reliable, scalable, secure, and AI-first manner. At InMobi, you get to work on innovative technologies, work closely with business teams and grow as an overall technology leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modern work environment, flexible schedule, and smart, creative, down-to-earth people. Internal opportunities to move roles and try out bridge assignments with different teams.&amp;nbsp; Food for your soul – free meals all days of the week, gym, or Yoga class to flex those biceps, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the team like?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are the CDR-AI team at InMobi, focused on building a next-generation Reporting, Analytics, and AI platform. Our mission is to transform raw data into actionable business insights for internal consumers while enabling seamless integration with multiple business and technology platforms.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a platform team, we work closely with different lines of business across InMobi to understand their reporting, analytics, automation, and AI-driven decisioning needs. This gives the team a unique opportunity to solve high-impact business problems while working on large-scale data, analytics, and GenAI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In addition to reporting and analytics, the team is expanding into AI engineering areas such as &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generative AI, LLMs, RAG, Agentic AI, and MCP-based integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. We also work across cloud and AI platforms including &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GCP, Microsoft Azure, databases, GKE, REST APIs, and modern deployment frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Microsoft positions Azure AI as an enterprise-grade platform for building AI apps and agents, which aligns with the team’s direction toward scalable AI-led platform capabilities.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key technology areas:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI/ML Engineering, Generative AI, LLMs, RAG, Agentic AI, MCP, Python, REST API Development, Spark, Java/J2EE, Airflow, Databricks, GKE, GCP, Microsoft Azure, Databases, Caching, Big Data Analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an independent senior engineer, owning complex problem statements and delivering scalable, reliable solutions aligned with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging technologies such as Agentic AI, Generative AI, and Copilot Studio, while mentoring the team on adoption and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, business, data, and engineering stakeholders, and communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate actively in architecture discussions, design reviews, sprint planning, and technical decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we expect from you? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build LLM-powered applications, chatbots, copilots, and multi-agent workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement GenAI solutions using frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, n8n, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain prompt templates, chains, agents, tools, and reusable AI workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate vector databases for semantic search, contextual retrieval, RAG, and memory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop backend services, REST APIs, and integrations to run AI models in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure AI solutions are explainable, accurate, compliant, secure, and aligned with finance policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and evaluate model and workflow performance on an ongoing basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize inference cost, latency, reliability, and overall system efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Data, Business, Sales, Finance, and Engineering teams to deliver end-to-end AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on emerging GenAI, AI/ML, agentic AI, and automation technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design reviews, sprint planning, technical discussions, and architecture reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, AI/ML, Data Science, or a related engineering discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of software development experience with hands-on expertise in &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python, SQL, TensorFlow/PyTorch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, and modern AI/ML frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM-powered applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, including prompt engineering, Retrieval-Augmented Generation, vector search, and fine-tuning pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;agentic AI frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; such as LangGraph, AutoGen, CrewAI, n8n, or ReAct-style agents. LangGraph is designed for customizable single-agent, multi-agent, and human-in-the-loop workflows. &lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REST APIs, microservices, and backend systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for production-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Context Protocol (MCP)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, including building or integrating MCP tools, servers, or capabilities. MCP enables servers to expose tools that language models can invoke to interact with external systems such as APIs, databases, and computation services. &lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD, Docker, and containerized application development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Docker provides a standard way to package and run applications in lightweight containers with their dependencies. &lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;data pipelines, APIs, databases, and cloud platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; such as Azure, GCP, or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving, analytical, and debugging skills, with the ability to work effectively in agile engineering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to collaborate with both technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of online advertising domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working on massively large-scale data systems in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of Big Data analytics domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of building AI products that are powered by data and insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with Enterprise Applications like SaleForce, MS dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on &lt;strong&gt;SDE-II – Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join InMobi’s Demand-Side Platform (DSP) team. In this role, you will build, maintain, and optimise scalable data pipelines that support programmatic advertising, campaign analytics, audience targeting, and attribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with batch and streaming data, distributed processing frameworks, cloud data platforms, and analytical storage systems to transform large volumes of data into reliable and actionable insights. You will collaborate with backend, product, and ML engineering teams to develop efficient data solutions that support DSP operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer with strong fundamentals in Python, SQL, and distributed data processing who is keen to solve data engineering challenges involving high-volume event streams, performance optimisation, and data reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;1. Data Engineering and Pipeline Development&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop, maintain, and optimise end-to-end &lt;strong&gt;batch and streaming data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; for processing events such as bid requests, impressions, clicks, and conversion signals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build data ingestion and transformation workflows using Python, SQL, Apache Spark/PySpark, and relevant data engineering frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with data lakehouse architectures and contribute to ingestion, storage, transformation, and serving layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Implement data quality checks, schema validation, error handling, and monitoring to ensure data accuracy and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support data modelling and query optimisation for analytical and reporting workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to pipeline performance improvements, resource utilisation, and efficient compute and storage usage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. Distributed Processing and Streaming&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with distributed data processing technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;Apache Spark, PySpark, and Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and support streaming workflows for processing event-driven data, with attention to data freshness, reliability, and processing efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Implement mechanisms for handling duplicate, delayed, or failed events, including retries, checkpointing, and recovery where applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Investigate production issues and troubleshoot data pipeline failures, performance bottlenecks, and data quality discrepancies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to the adoption and effective use of technologies such as Apache Flink, Spark Structured Streaming, and open table formats where relevant to the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Data Storage and Analytics&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with cloud-based data platforms and storage services to support scalable data processing and analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and optimise SQL queries, data transformations, partitioning strategies, and table structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to analytical data stores such as StarRocks, ClickHouse, or similar technologies, based on project requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with data lake table formats such as Apache Iceberg, Delta Lake, or Apache Hudi, where applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support data modelling, metadata management, access controls, and data retention practices in line with established engineering standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;4. Collaboration and Engineering Practices&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with backend engineers, ML engineers, and other stakeholders to understand data requirements and deliver reliable data solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with workflow orchestration tools such as Apache Airflow or equivalent to schedule, monitor, and manage data pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in code reviews, technical discussions, testing, and deployment activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Follow engineering best practices for version control, CI/CD, observability, documentation, and production readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement by identifying opportunities to enhance pipeline reliability, scalability, performance, and cost efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Skills and Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience and Education&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2–5 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in software engineering, data engineering, or big data development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience developing and maintaining data pipelines in a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience handling large datasets or distributed data processing workloads is preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to ad-tech, programmatic advertising, real-time bidding (RTB), or event-driven systems is an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Core Data Engineering Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong programming skills in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good command of &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, including joins, aggregations, data transformations, and query optimisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Apache Spark/PySpark&lt;/strong&gt; or a comparable distributed data processing framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building and maintaining ETL/ELT pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of batch processing and streaming data concepts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to workflow orchestration tools such as Apache Airflow, Prefect, or Dagster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of data modelling, partitioning, schema evolution, and data quality practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Streaming, Cloud, and Data Platform Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with Apache Kafka or similar messaging and streaming technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to AWS, GCP, or Azure data services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with data lakes, lakehouse architectures, or analytical databases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to Apache Iceberg, Delta Lake, Apache Hudi, StarRocks, or ClickHouse is an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of monitoring, logging, error handling, and production troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience processing high-volume event data or building near-real-time data pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to ad-tech datasets such as bid requests, impressions, clicks, conversions, campaign performance, or attribution data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with Java or Scala in addition to Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic understanding of REST APIs, microservices, and event-driven architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD tools is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience collaborating with ML teams on feature engineering or training data pipelines is an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

