&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Development Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Demonstrated ability to identify and pursue new business opportunities, including prospecting, cold calling, and networking to generate leads and expand the customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A proactive and innovative approach to sales, with a mindset focused on growth, creativity, and taking ownership of outcomes. This includes a willingness to experiment with new strategies and approaches to achieve sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinker:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Capable of developing and executing strategic sales plans that align with company objectives and market trends. This involves analyzing market data, identifying growth opportunities, and adapting tactics accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous and Self-Motivated:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comfortable working independently and taking initiative to drive sales initiatives forward. This includes being self-motivated to meet and exceed sales targets without constant supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion and Commitment:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrates a strong passion for the product and industry, coupled with a commitment to delivering exceptional customer service and building long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk-Taker and Resilient:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Willingness to embrace risk and overcome setbacks with resilience. Ideal candidate embodies founder&#39;s mentality, often entails a high tolerance for ambiguity and the ability to navigate uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Centric Approach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prioritizes understanding customer needs and providing tailored solutions that add value and drive customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to think creatively to address customer challenges and differentiate the company&#39;s offerings in a competitive market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Potential:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exhibits leadership qualities such as vision, influence, and the ability to inspire and motivate others toward shared goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate drives immediate sales but also contributes to the overall growth and success of the business through their entrepreneurial mindset and strategic thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our hiring process, shortlisted candidates will undergo a Background Verification (BGV). By applying, you consent to sharing personal information required for this process. Any offer made will be subject to successful completion of the BGV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How do we work? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whatever your role, our values describe what we ask of each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a bridger&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Look beyond your own role. Ask questions, share context and help others get unstuck. That may mean bringing the right people together or picking up a problem that doesn’t necessarily fit neatly into your job description.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Care loudly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want your perspective, not just your agreement. Speak up when something isn’t working or someone needs support. Give honest feedback with respect for the person receiving it. Don’t let an uncomfortable conversation become an unspoken problem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Take responsibility for the result, not just your part in the process. Use AI to move the work forward, not to outsource your judgment. Make the call, check whether it worked and change course when it didn’t. If something goes wrong, own it and help fix it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;That’s DevRev!&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;DevRev is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DevRev&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DevRev, we&#39;re building the future of work with &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; – your AI teammate. Unlike traditional tools, &lt;em&gt;Computer&lt;/em&gt; unifies all your data sources, tools, and workflows into a single AI-ready platform, giving employees real-time insights, proactive suggestions, and powerful agentic actions. It extends your existing software with AI-native apps and agents that work alongside your teams and customers – updating workflows, coordinating across teams, and eliminating repetitive work. We call this Team Intelligence: human-AI collaboration that breaks down silos, brings people back together, and frees you to solve bigger problems. Backed by Khosla Ventures and Mayfield with $150M+ raised, DevRev is trusted by global companies across industries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;165&quot; data-end=&quot;499&quot;&gt;As a Solutions Engineer, you will partner closely with Sales, Product, and Engineering to guide customers through the evaluation and adoption of our platform. Acting as a trusted technical advisor, you will lead discovery, design tailored solutions, deliver impactful demos, and support technical validation through proofs of concept.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;501&quot; data-end=&quot;679&quot;&gt;This role blends technical expertise with customer-facing communication, helping translate complex requirements into scalable solutions while clearly articulating business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bdzpnn&quot; data-start=&quot;709&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;Lead customer discovery to uncover business needs and define solution requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f8y7vy&quot; data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;882&quot;&gt;Design scalable solutions aligned to customer use cases and technical environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;de8llv&quot; data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;968&quot;&gt;Deliver tailored product demos that clearly communicate value and differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;awfc4a&quot; data-start=&quot;969&quot; data-end=&quot;1041&quot;&gt;Build and execute proofs of concept (PoCs) and technical validations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ypv921&quot; data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1130&quot;&gt;Translate customer requirements into architectures, integrations, and configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c1p1b2&quot; data-start=&quot;1131&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales to progress deals by addressing technical objections and risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m7ym0m&quot; data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;Support RFP/RFI responses and contribute to technical proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3pbwxr&quot; data-start=&quot;1285&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, and Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1542166&quot; data-start=&quot;1368&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;Enable partners through training, workshops, and joint solution development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ogwu9y&quot; data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;Develop reusable demo assets, playbooks, and technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
