&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mlt0gm&quot; data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1650&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in Solutions Engineering / Sales Engineering in a B2B SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15y3bcf&quot; data-start=&quot;1651&quot; data-end=&quot;1729&quot;&gt;Strong&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;discovery and qualification skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;with a consultative approach&lt;/li&gt;
