&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n8ena7&quot; data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1920&quot;&gt;Experience delivering&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1847&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;compelling demos and technical storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to diverse stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
