&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y2ukn5&quot; data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2109&quot;&gt;Ability to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2027&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;articulate business value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and align technical solutions to customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
