&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two Hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 4 million Hosts who have welcomed more than 1 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, Hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Analytics Centre of Excellence (ACOE) at Airbnb, based in India, is a hub of knowledge and expertise that aims to provide data-driven decision-making, enabling Airbnb&#39;s business goals. The ACOE&#39;s vision is to build a world-class analytics organization that provides scalable analytics. We work with various business functions such as payments, trust, digital, customer support, hosting, sales, social, compliance, risk, platforms and partnership &amp;amp; economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ACOE&#39;s delivery framework is designed to provide relevant and contextual insights for data-driven decisions. This includes a one-stop solution for metrics, dashboards driving actionable insights, optimization of performance, measuring pre/post feature impact, sizing the ROI of opportunities, prioritization of opportunities, anomaly-driven alerting mechanisms, root cause analysis of metric deviation, and exploratory hypothesis testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a Senior Analyst&amp;nbsp; to serve as an AI Vision Multiplier for the CS organisation — a builder-analyst with a clear mandate to translate Airbnb’s internal AI capabilities into working solutions that make AI-powered analytics accessible, trusted, and actionable across CS. &lt;/strong&gt;The analyst must have functional expertise in building analytical solutions and be a trusted partner to business teams and leaders, through providing insights, recommendations, and enabling data driven decisions. This role will sit under the Advanced Analytics family and support Business leaders within our Community Support organization.&amp;nbsp; You will partner directly with functions and operational leaders across Community Support. This role will be responsible for making CS smarter and faster, and enable self-serve through data. You will be the team’s dedicated AI practitioner, building agentic solutions and intelligent interfaces that elevate the entire organisation toward self-serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build agentic analytics pipelines that automate insight generation across all key metrics including contact volume, handle time, and resolution quality — reducing analytical drag across CS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable skill libraries — composable agent tools (volume lookups, NPS pulls, handle time calculations) callable across workflows and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and govern prompt templates and playbooks — standardised, governed prompts for recurring analytical questions (e.g. “what drove contact volume this week”).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build orchestration workflows — multi-step pipelines that chain skills together to produce automated insight narratives and proactive alerts without manual intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy self-serve interfaces that enable non-technical personas to query certified data independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship rapid, prompt-driven dashboards that compress the cycle from business question to live view, serving varied personas without analyst bottleneck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate business reviews — scheduled, agent-generated summaries of key CS metrics delivered to stakeholders without manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain evaluation and observability frameworks that monitor agent output quality, detect drift, and ensure outputs stay within governed data boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, document, and certify metrics within Minerva 2.0 and Midas, ensuring agentic outputs and self-serve interfaces are anchored to a single source of truth across CS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the analytics roadmap, prioritization, and delivery of solutions in up to a quarter ahead. Execute projects with regular direction providing constant updates to business stakeholders, analytics management and deliver against agreed timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with CS operational leaders to translate ambiguous business problems into agentic or automated analytical solutions — independently scoping, building, and iterating end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype and ship prompt-driven dashboards and apps, compressing the cycle from question to live view for varied CS personas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and iterate on skill libraries and orchestration workflows, expanding the reusable agent toolkit available to the CS Analytics team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor agent output quality via observability frameworks, identifying drift or hallucinations and maintaining governance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with key stakeholders to prioritise the self-serve and automation needs, setting and delivering against a quarterly roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay at the forefront of applied AI developments, evaluating new tools and frameworks for relevance to CS use cases and embedding them rapidly into workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the availability of data quality and integrity for analysis and reporting by blending external and internal data sources, working closely with global operations and India analytics functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in analytics/data science with a strong track record of solving ambiguous business problems and driving measurable impact, shipping AI-enabled solutions, not just analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to own end-to-end data projects — from problem scoping and data extraction to analysis, insight generation (including BI tools), and business recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL and Python at production-grade standard, with experience on large-scale data systems (Presto, Hive, Spark).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapid front-end prototyping — vibe-coded dashboards, apps, or embedded analytics built at speed for non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Tableau proficiency for certified, production-grade BI delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrics governance and certification — ability to define, document, and certify metrics, ensuring agentic outputs are anchored to a single source of truth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production LLM and prompt engineering experience — shipped LLM-integrated workflows, governed prompt libraries, and retrieval-based systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic system and orchestration design — tool chaining, context management, and building reliable pipelines with minimal human-in-the-loop intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RAG, vector databases, and semantic search — applied to unstructured contact and case data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agent output evaluation and observability — experience monitoring AI pipeline quality and maintaining governance guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to translate complex AI-powered solutions into clear narratives for non-technical business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter mindset with high ownership, comfortable operating with quarterly autonomy in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is inclusive of allowances and is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus or incentives, one or more equity programs, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;India Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹1,960,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹2,800,000 INR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The communications team is responsible for telling the Airbnb story around the world. Whether we are briefing press on inspiring travel trends, highlighting unique experiences led by local hosts, or explaining how travel on our platform benefits local families and communities, we are the voice of Airbnb on a broad range of topics. We&#39;re a fast growing and high energy team with a passion for people, places and great stories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in India, we&#39;re looking for a Senior Communications Lead, India, to own Airbnb&#39;s communications strategy in one of our most important growth markets. Reporting to the APAC Communications Director, you&#39;ll lead the India communications team and agency partners. You&#39;ll drive the work behind our consumer, policy and corporate goals, and act as a senior advisor to India leadership. You&#39;ll shape how Airbnb is seen in India, making sure local plans meet business needs while staying in line with regional and global priorities. We&#39;re looking for someone who can lead Consumer, Product, Policy and Corporate Communications under one roof, thinking holistically about strategy across all of them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re an experienced, strategic communicator who is at ease with senior executives, government stakeholders and top-tier media. You can handle complexity, ambiguity and pressure, and you bring sound judgment to high-stakes moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and own the multi-year India communications strategy, aligned with global and regional priorities and tied to measurable business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit on the India Leadership Team as the communications voice, helping shape business priorities and drive growth in the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Consumer, Product, Policy and Corporate Communications as one integrated function, with a single strategy that connects all four&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Marketing, Product, Policy and Business teams in a MarComms model, so communications supports business strategy and delivers measurable business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to the India Country Manager and to visiting global executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and grow the India communications team and agency partners, building capability and a culture of creative, high-quality work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the team prioritize against business goals, give clear direction on where to focus, and coach them on trade-offs and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee editorial communications, national campaigns and the news calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Public Policy on regulatory and government-relations communications, and position Airbnb as a constructive voice on tourism in India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead issues and crisis management for India: prepare scenarios, guide the response, and protect reputation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive visibility and thought-leadership platforms for local and global leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain senior relationships with national, business and regional media across India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics, report impact to regional and global leadership, and manage the market budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent India in APAC and global communications planning, sharing local insights that shape wider strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s / Master&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communications experience across agency and in-house, including senior roles leading teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and executing communications strategy in India for a consumer or tech brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network across Indian national, business and regional media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in corporate, policy and/or reputation communications, including handling high-profile issues and crises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or working with agencies that manage influencer and celebrity work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising C-suite executives and working with government and policy stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven people leader who has built and grown high-performing teams and managed agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment, composure under pressure, and the ability to influence across a global matrix organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing and verbal communication skills in English; Hindi or another Indian language is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic and entrepreneurial, with a strong focus on measurable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is inclusive of allowances and is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus or incentives, one or more equity programs, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;India Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹6,720,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹9,600,000 INR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Quality team ensures that Community Support, AirCover, Payments, Compliance, and Supply operations consistently meet the highest standards, blending rigorous QA frameworks with AI-enabled AutoQA to catch issues early, protect trust, and keep experiences safe and reliable at global scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This senior leader is accountable for the end-to-end quality program at the Airbnb Capability Center (ACC), which spans multiple business functions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Community Support - Volume Tiers, Safety, Premium Support, CS Labs Annotation, Regulatory Response, Payments, and Executive Escalations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AirCover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Compliance/ZTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Payments Risk &amp;amp; Ops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Supply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This leader oversees a team of ~71 employees, with seven direct reports, and carries quality accountability for both internal ACC teams and a network of external partner/vendor sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Additionally, this leader needs to support Quality transformation efforts, including:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Migration to a new quality management system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Shifting from manual QA to AI enabled AutoQA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establishing a Human in the Loop program, that monitors AI model accuracy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will arrive with a clear point of view on what world-class quality looks like when AI is doing most of the volume and humans are doing the highest-judgment work;&amp;nbsp; and can hold the line on the legal and ethical guardrails that come with it. This role reports to the Director of Quality for Global Operations, and represents ACC (“Airbnb India / Team India”) quality in global forums.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Program Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own and execute the ACC quality strategy across all supported functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive alignment with the global quality framework, working in collaboration with various stakeholders, including the Quality and Delivery leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Represent ACC Quality in Weekly Ops Reviews, MBRs, Enablement Ops Reviews, Leadership Group Connects, and QBRs; deliver a proactive narrative that surfaces emerging risk rather than reporting lagging metrics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Thought leadership on new programs, such as continuous calibration of AI-based Auto QA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Quality Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee QA evaluation execution across all ACC functions, ensuring consistent application of frameworks as the organization migrates to COPC-aligned frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Operate Audit-the-Auditor as an ongoing control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Delivery and other stakeholders to improve quality performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights, Reporting &amp;amp; Stakeholder Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively share insights with Delivery on performance deepdives and analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with analytical teams on anomaly-detection and quality dashboards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Implement detractor-analysis frameworks (global detractor / NPS patterns) so systemic issues surface in real time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, AutoQA &amp;amp; Technology Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive AutoQA adoption across ACC tiers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Engineering on calibration model for AutoQA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive and sponsor high-value process automation at ACC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Culture Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead a large team that spans multiple business functions (Volume Tier, Safety, AirCover, Compliance, Premium Support, Payments, Supply, CS Labs, Insights); grow leaders through active development planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Foster a One-Quality-Team culture across internal ACC and partner sites: shared best practices, cross-functional calibration, and proactive knowledge sharing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Set high expectations for output quality, insight delivery, and stakeholder engagement, and hold the team accountable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with global Quality peers to ensure one consistent quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in Customer/Community Support, Quality, Operations, or Trust &amp;amp; Safety, including direct experience leading quality programs in sensitive, high-stakes, or regulated support environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience building or transforming quality programs for complex, multi-function support portfolios.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in quality methodologies (COPC, AQS, Six Sigma, Lean) and the ability to apply them across high-volume and high-complexity support alike.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on ownership of QA tooling: form design, calibration management, and AutoQA deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing globally distributed quality teams across multiple functions, languages, and partner organizations in a 24/7 environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience deploying or scaling AI/ML-assisted QA (AutoQA, predictive NPS/CSAT).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong executive presence: able to influence senior stakeholders, present a unified quality narrative in leadership forums, and drive cross-functional alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with vendor/partner governance: calibration oversight, performance-improvement plans, and escalation frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Master&#39;s degree or equivalent in Business, Operations, Law, Risk Management, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;COPC certification; Six Sigma Green or Black Belt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Observe.AI (and migration off legacy platforms such as NICE/Nexidia).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Background in program management, change management, or organizational design in a high-growth tech environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience operating within BPO/vendor governance models at scale (1,000+ partner FTEs across multiple sites and geographies).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience operating in a global capability center.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is inclusive of allowances and is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus or incentives, one or more equity programs, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;India Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹5,900,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹8,500,000 INR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No global movement springs from individuals. It takes an entire team united behind something big. On the Delivery team at Airbnb, we&#39;re proud to be at the forefront of the sharing economy. We recognize that we are the leaders of a new, worldwide phenomenon, and that&#39;s why we&#39;re working so hard to build the world&#39;s most loyal travel community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, our team provides support to more than 100 million lifetime guests and 3 million listings in over 191 countries. Our India Global operations hub delivers several of Community Support&#39;s most sensitive and complex specialty services, working as one team with our global process leads. We are looking for an agile, operationally strong leader who knows how to motivate and inspire teams in a cutting-edge and fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, Safety you will own end-to-end delivery for a portfolio of Global Operation&#39;s most sensitive and highest-severity specialty services, spanning close to 200 team members across Specialists, Team Specialists, Supervisors and Managers. You will be accountable for KPIs, people and the overall health of the business, with direct exposure to user-safety, regulatory and financial-loss risk and the authority to make final calls on complex, irreversible decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as senior delivery partner to the global process leads for your services — translating global agendas into on-the-ground execution and giving those leads a single accountable counterpart at site. You will be expected to build and maintain trusted relationships with senior stakeholders while constantly looking for opportunities to streamline and optimize our operations. As our portfolio evolves, you should expect the mix of services in scope to change, and be comfortable picking up new skills and queues as the business requires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Drive delivery performance across the portfolio:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day operations of the services in scope, driving the highest level of performance from the teams and establishing the right performance management and coaching structure and cadence in collaboration with Delivery leaders and Quality teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, monitor, report and improve efficiency and quality metrics for each service based on its performance scorecard, keeping Global operations in India aligned to global standards while accounting for local nuance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt and pre-empt adaptations of the performance management structure based on shifting business priorities, volume patterns and peak planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a data-driven lens to occupancy, SLA, capacity and workforce decisions, and make timely calls when the numbers move&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead and grow a multi-layered leadership team:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a mixed layer of leadership — a Manager alongside Supervisors reporting in directly — which means being comfortable leading junior leadership hands-on rather than only through a manager layer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach Supervisors on daily performance management as readily as you set quarterly direction, and stay close enough to the floor to spot execution gaps early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Managers and Supervisors to ensure high employee engagement and delivery of a world class experience for both our community and our internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee team structure, recruitment, onboarding, training and upskilling plans, and build a credible succession and cross-skilling pipeline across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a focused, visible leader who creates supportive connections across the whole team through open communication, and who carries teams through change and periods of instability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Partner with global process leads and eliminate functional silos:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of global Ops priorities and make sure ACC delivery is set up to execute them — owning the on-the-ground landing of global programmes to timeline and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface operational pain points early enough to influence global design rather than after the fact, and carry ACC best practice back into the global forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across services and with Quality, Training, Business Process Improvement, Analytics and WFM to eliminate functional and working silos, so process changes land consistently rather than function by function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed insights into process, policy and tooling improvements, and drive relationships and coordinate requests with shared services teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the global consolidation agenda where ACC is scaling towards becoming the primary or sole servicing site for a skill, ensuring transitions land without disruption to the community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Manage senior and executive stakeholders:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible and accountable for executive and senior leadership stakeholder management, adapting your communication to the audience and remaining flexible and available to our leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a deep understanding and expertise of our operations, workflows, policies and systems, so you can assess cases yourself and make the right call on what needs to be done to solve our users&#39; issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent ACC credibly in global forums, holding policy, quality and risk conversations independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work with the long term in mind to reduce the volume and severity of complex cases:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and understand the common themes behind complex cases and escalations, close the loop, and set up the right forums to solve root causes with cross-functional teams across Global Ops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional Airbnb teams to champion improvements to our process, policies and product that improve the customer experience and reduce community escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong end-to-end frontline operations management experience in a customer-facing environment, with a track record of owning KPIs, people and business health for a large team; overall experience of minimum 13 years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly agile — able to pick up new skills, services and queues quickly, and to re-prioritize as the portfolio and global agenda shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced people leadership, performance management, coaching and mentoring experience, including leading through both a manager layer and direct supervisor relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating hands-on with junior leadership: coaching Supervisors on daily execution while holding a longer-term agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a high-pressure environment with visibility to sensitive, confidential and potentially traumatic content, and to support a team working with the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in complex case management with VP-level stakeholders and above preferred; crisis management or Trust &amp;amp; Safety experience in a marketplace business is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influencing, presentation, interpersonal and teamwork skills — able to work collaboratively and consultatively across expansive business partner organizations, including global process leads and shared services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple complex, fast-moving situations at once and make sound decisions with incomplete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with strong project management skills, able to switch between very tactical, urgent work and long-term planning or programme management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and a data-driven approach to operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, strong attention to detail, and the ability to prioritize and deliver in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to take a team through significant change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent required; MBA or other Master&#39;s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to flex working hours to respond to global business demand; a high level of reactivity is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable to work in 24*7 rotational shifts with your team, and work from office in Gurugram.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion &amp;amp; belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is inclusive of allowances and is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus or incentives, one or more equity programs, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;India Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹4,900,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹7,000,000 INR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to millions of hosts who have welcomed guests in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Payments Risk Operations team protects Airbnb&#39;s guests, hosts, and the platform from fraud, financial loss, and abuse. Our investigators and agents review high-risk activity every day, and the quality of their tools directly shapes the speed, accuracy, and consistency of every decision they make. You will join a team of operators, analysts, and program leaders who partner closely with Platform, Engineering, Data Science, Design, and Legal to keep our community safe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Risk Tools &amp;amp; Automation Lead, you will own the end-to-end agent experience for risk and fraud operations. You will define what our investigators need, design and conceptualize the next generation of the risk workbench, and drive automation through process efficiencies and AI. You will be the voice of the agent in tooling decisions and the bridge between operational reality and technical execution. Your work will reduce manual effort, shorten handle times, improve decision quality, and free our experts to focus on the most complex cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end agent experience across risk and fraud investigation workflows, from case intake through decision, documentation, and quality review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend time with agents to observe workflows, map pain points, and quantify friction in handle time, clicks, context switching, and error rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish feedback loops (surveys, office hours, champion networks, ticket intake) so agent needs are captured, prioritized, and closed out transparently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Training, Quality, and Workforce Management to ensure tooling changes land with clear enablement, documentation, and adoption tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling requirements and improvements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate operational needs into clear, prioritized business requirements, user stories, and acceptance criteria that Platform and Engineering can build against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the operational risk tooling roadmap and backlog, balancing quick wins, foundational investments, and policy or regulatory needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead intake, triage, and prioritization of tooling requests using impact sizing (time saved, loss prevented, accuracy gained, risk reduced).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive user acceptance testing (UAT), launch readiness, and post-launch measurement for every tooling release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workbench design and conceptualization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the long-term vision for a unified risk workbench that brings signals, account history, payment data, linked entities, and decisioning into a single, intuitive workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Platform, Design, and UX Research to run discovery, build journey maps, create wireframes and prototypes, and conduct usability testing with agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion design principles of simplicity, consistency, and accessibility so agents can make accurate decisions quickly and confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation through efficiencies and AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, size, and prioritize automation opportunities across manual and repetitive work, including case routing, data gathering, enrichment, summarization, and low-risk decisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Platform, Engineering, and Data Science to design and deploy AI-assisted capabilities such as case summaries, recommended actions, agent copilots, and automated documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define human-in-the-loop guardrails, quality controls, and monitoring so automation improves efficiency without compromising accuracy, fairness, or compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases that tie automation to measurable outcomes and report progress to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary operations policy partner to Platform, Engineering, Data Science, Design, Policy, Legal, Compliance, and Finance on all risk tooling initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence without authority, align technical and non-technical stakeholders on priorities, tradeoffs, and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate roadmaps, launches, and impact clearly to audiences ranging from frontline agents to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in operations, program management, or product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in fraud, payment risk, trust and safety, or a related investigations industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required; Master&#39;s degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of writing successful business requirements, user stories, and acceptance criteria that led to shipped tools with measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with user experience testing and design, including discovery interviews, journey mapping, usability testing, and working from wireframes or prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in cross-functional collaboration with both technical partners (Engineering, Data Science, Platform) and non-technical partners (Operations, Legal, Compliance, Finance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying and delivering automation or process efficiency improvements at scale, with results tied to metrics such as handle time, throughput, accuracy, or loss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with comfort using data to size opportunities, build business cases, and measure outcomes (SQL or similar skills a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, with the ability to simplify complex technical and operational concepts for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing or launching agent workbenches, case management systems, or investigation consoles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying generative AI or large language models in operational settings, such as agent copilots, case summarization, or automated decision support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of fraud and risk domains such as payment fraud, chargebacks, account takeover, identity verification, or AML.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow and automation platforms (for example, rules engines, RPA, or low-code tools) and with agile delivery practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading change management and driving adoption across large, globally distributed operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at an e-commerce, travel, fintech, or payments company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is inclusive of allowances and is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus or incentives, one or more equity programs, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;India Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹3,780,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;₹5,400,000 INR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payments&lt;/strong&gt; is key for any healthy marketplace, and is just as central to our product at Airbnb. The Payments organization at Airbnb is responsible for everything related to settling money in Airbnb’s global marketplace and makes the Payment experience as delightful, magical, intuitive, and easy as possible. At the Payments team, our goal is to build and operate scalable systems that power payments ecosystems, host/guest protections as well as community partner&amp;nbsp; experiences applying core engineering principles that leverage both time-tested and cutting edge technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Staff Engineering for Payments, you will provide overarching guardrails on evolution of the architecture with special focus on Community Partner experiences, catering evolving business needs and coaching other engineers on the team. You will envision and design decision support systems, knowledge management systems as well as workflow orchestration systems that can harness various AI advancements. You will define and drive the architecture strategy, work on cross-functional teams to align on organizational initiatives, set standards and help in governance. You will be a player-coach; in that you will be hands-on when a situation arises (player mode) and hands-off where there is opportunity for other engineers to grow and gain experience (coach mode).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Staff Software Engineer, Payments you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other senior leaders to define and drive long-term technical strategy and architecture that enables the company’s future vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a technical vision and lead efforts to architect, build, and launch reliable, performant, and scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a critic for existing and new technologies, providing a balanced view of the technology landscape and nurture a culture of sustainable innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with and influence cross-functional partners to design and deliver high-quality products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multi-team technical initiatives, and work cross-functionally to identify opportunities for business impact, refine, and prioritize requirements for engineering systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead conversations that align technical efforts with business outcomes and product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uplevel engineering quality through design/code reviews, mentorship, and hands-on implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide technical guidance to junior engineers&amp;nbsp; through design reviews, code walkthroughs, and knowledge-sharing sessions, fostering a culture of knowledge sharing and continuous learning .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in a hands-on software engineering role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s and/or Master’s degree, preferably in CS, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, leading, and architecting production systems or features with broad impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical leadership: hands on experience leading project teams, setting technical direction and strategy, prototyping to iterate ideas, and working cross functionally with Product, Design and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills with both technical and non-technical partners, experience driving initiatives that span across teams, departments and leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion to level-up those around you through curiosity and fostering a collaborative and inclusive team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in defining product/technical strategy and driving alignment with cross-functional leaders and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is India - Remote (Eligible anywhere within India). The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join an elite process team focused on premium, high-stakes customer interactions, supporting high-end guests and Hosts within the Airbnb community. The environment is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multicultural and hospitality-oriented, with exposure to high-profile and influential clientele.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Gurugram / Delhi-NCR, with an expectation of in-office work aligned with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast-paced, complex, and ambiguous, requiring adaptability, responsiveness, and professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, involving close interaction with internal stakeholders and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver bespoke, high-quality customer support that reflects Airbnb’s commitment to excellence, especially for high-end customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take complete ownership of complex and high-stakes cases, ensuring final resolution or settlement and building strong relationships with users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine efficiency with personalized service, handling high case volumes without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively enhance the customer experience by anticipating needs, offering relevant solutions, and going above and beyond in every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement by sharing insights about the community experience and supporting your team’s operational success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust with internal and external stakeholders through effective relationship management and consistent delivery of results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help uphold top hospitality standards in every interaction, influencing user satisfaction and brand perception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing Personalized and Exceptional Customer Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interacting with guests and Hosts through live chat, social platforms, messaging, and phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the specific needs of high-end customers and tailoring your communication and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapting your approach to diverse cultural backgrounds and individual preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex Case Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning assigned cases end-to-end, following workflows and management guidelines to reach final resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercising sound judgment and an ownership mentality, escalating to other teams when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being receptive to feedback from management and quality teams and quickly applying it to improve your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining Efficiency with Bespoke Quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a high volume of cases while maintaining personalized, high-quality service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolving issues quickly and effectively to ensure mutual satisfaction and uphold hospitality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in Your Team’s Improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using your operational knowledge to support team success and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing feedback and insights on community experience and improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping document ways of working, best practices, and norms as requested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offering technical/functional/subject-matter guidance to less experienced team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Going Above and Beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipating customer needs and proactively suggesting solutions or options to smooth their experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responding promptly and efficiently to inquiries and issues, ensuring timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trust with internal and external stakeholders through consistent delivery and open communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrating openness and approachability when resolving issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding key functional drivers and their business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being on-call for emergency situations in evenings and weekends, as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background &amp;amp; experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of relevant experience in multicultural customer service teams, preferably in hospitality and premium support (experience with Apple, Amex (David Jones), Amazon premium support, Ritz Carlton is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in roles involving calls and customer/client contacts, ideally with high-profile or influential clientele.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate degree or above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hospitality experience, particularly with technology platforms, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience using phone, messaging, or live chat to interact with users/customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging with executive-level stakeholders to resolve conflicts in a detailed, effective, and timely manner, with the ability to explain complex ideas simply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to work weekends, public holidays, and evening shifts; schedule may change based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Gurgaon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to work in 24*7 rotational shifts, work from office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills for engaging guests, Hosts, and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to understand guest needs and provide personalized recommendations and assistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving abilities and emotional intelligence to identify root causes and fully resolve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage high volumes of work, multitask, prioritize, and adhere to schedules (breaks, lunches, training).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong passion for delivering exceptional customer service and setting a high bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in an ambiguous, fast-paced, and complex environment, acting proactively and decisively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Apple/Mac OS, Google Suite, CRM systems, and the ability to quickly learn new tools (including Google Sheets, Google Docs, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of professionalism, confidentiality, adaptability, responsiveness, proactiveness, resourcefulness, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
