&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IRL (Instawork Robotics Labs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Researchers at UC Berkeley have identified a “100,000-year data gap” - the gulf between what trained AI language models and what physical robots actually have to learn from. Closing that gap is the defining infrastructure challenge of the physical AI era. IRL is Instawork’s answer to it. We deploy skilled workers into real commercial and residential environments - kitchens, warehouses, hotel floors, homes - to capture the high-fidelity task data that the world’s leading Robotics labs use to train their foundation models. Read more&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/sumirmeghani/status/2044707303262237129&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Head of Partnerships &lt;/strong&gt;to build and lead our India business partners. You will be responsible for identifying, developing, and onboarding thousands of small, medium and large businesses across India to help build the pipeline for Robotics data collection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The opportunity is to connect Instawork&#39;s technology, labor marketplace, and operational scale with the world&#39;s leading robotics companies and turn real-world work into the high-quality data required to train and improve the next generation of physical AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly entrepreneurial role for a senior partnerships leader who wants to build something from the ground up and work directly with company leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Build the Partnerships Engine for Small, Medium and Large businesses in India&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the&amp;nbsp; partnerships strategy across hospitality, logistics, manufacturing, warehousing, retail, and other labor-intensive industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and eventually lead the partnerships team, processes, systems, and operating cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear goals and metrics for pipeline generation and business acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute large business partnerships with industrial, co-operative and government bodies that work with multiple businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable playbooks for partner identification, outreach, qualification, negotiation, and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Directly with Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the CEO and Head of Robotics on the company&#39;s partnership strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring market intelligence, partner feedback, and new opportunities directly to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move quickly from strategy to execution, with a strong bias toward action and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in partnerships, business development, strategic alliances, or a similar commercial leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing fleet on street and also building and closing large B2B partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a partnerships or business development function from the ground up is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network across hospitality, logistics, manufacturing, warehousing, retail, marketplaces, or other labor-intensive industries is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset—you enjoy building rather than inheriting an established playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely strong bias for action and ownership. You see a problem and figure out how to solve it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating with ambiguity, limited structure, and rapidly changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially sharp, highly driven, and comfortable being measured by outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
