&lt;li&gt;Close and launch high-impact partnerships with multiple industrial, cooperative or government organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a repeatable&amp;nbsp; partnership acquisition playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a scalable partnerships organization and operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help position Instawork as a critical infrastructure partner for companies building the future of Physical AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
