&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-on, High Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive problem-solver who thrives on the floor building processes and tackling operational challenges directly, rather than just administering them.&lt;/p&gt;
