&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Sales Manager - Instawork Robotics Labs || &lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Bengaluru, India (Extensive Travel)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IRL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Researchers at UC Berkeley have identified a “100,000-year data gap” - the gulf between what trained AI language models and what physical robots actually have to learn from. Closing that gap is the defining infrastructure challenge of the physical AI era. IRL is Instawork’s answer to it. We deploy skilled workers into real commercial and residential environments - kitchens, warehouses, hotel floors, homes - to capture the high-fidelity task data that the world’s leading Robotics labs use to train their foundation models. Read more &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/sumirmeghani/status/2044707303262237129&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Instawork is building the data engine for the future of physical AI. To do that at scale, we need reliable, high-volume access to businesses across India whose skilled manual work becomes the training data for the next generation of robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for Regional Sales Manager to secure that access — both by hunting new opportunities directly and by brokering relationships with the people who already control access to hundreds of businesses: association presidents, lenders, government officials, and enterprise leaders. Your job is to convert both cold outreach and high-trust institutional relationships into onboarding pathways at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Instawork Robotics records skilled manual work with lightweight wearable cameras at partner&amp;nbsp;businesses (factories, hospitals, hotels, workshops and shops), and pays those businesses for every&amp;nbsp;hour recorded. This footage is used to train robotics and physical AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;As a Regional Sales Manager you will own one territory in your city, lead a team of 5 Sales Executives, and personally sign the largest businesses in your area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sell to large businesses&lt;br&gt;• &lt;/strong&gt;Win large and mid-sized partners (factories, hospitals, hotels, labs) by meeting owners, plant&amp;nbsp;heads and administrators.&lt;br&gt;• Pitch the business value: productivity insights, workstation safety analysis, and a route into&amp;nbsp;automation programmes.&lt;br&gt;• Work longer sales cycles: repeat visits, safety and site approvals, and getting the decision-maker&amp;nbsp;to say yes.&lt;br&gt;• Stay the main point of contact for every business you sign, through recording and payments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead your team&lt;br&gt;• &lt;/strong&gt;Hire, train and lead 5 Sales Executives who sign small shops and workshops across your territory.&lt;br&gt;• Run a short daily team meeting and a weekly review against targets.&lt;br&gt;• Split your territory so no two people on your team approach the same business.&lt;br&gt;• Make sure every business your team signs is genuine and recorded correctly in our app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Report and improve&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;• Share weekly numbers with your Zonal Leader: businesses signed, hours recorded and gaps by&amp;nbsp;business type.&lt;br&gt;• Flag what is working and what isn&#39;t in the pitch, pricing or process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Must have&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;• 5–8 years in B2B field sales.&lt;br&gt;• At least 1–2 years leading a field sales team of 4 or more people.&lt;br&gt;• A track record of closing deals that needed sign-off from an owner, plant head or senior&amp;nbsp;administrator.&lt;br&gt;• Comfort on the shop floor: shifts, supervisors, contract labour, safety audits.&lt;br&gt;• Fluency in the local language of your city, plus English.&lt;br&gt;• Your own two-wheeler or car, and willingness to be in the field most days.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to have&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;• Experience in industrial automation, machinery or tools, safety equipment, industrial chemicals,&amp;nbsp;facility management, or hospital and lab equipment.&lt;br&gt;• Existing relationships with industrial associations or business owners in your city.&lt;br&gt;• Hindi, if you are based in Pune, Hyderabad or Surat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Empathy, Trust &amp;amp; Candor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We put ourselves in the shoes of our colleagues and customers and don’t shy away from uncomfortable conversations, instead building trust through honest and direct feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Bias for Action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We practice high-velocity decision-making, clear-eyed that we often operate with incomplete information. Growing quickly means it’s OK to be wrong, so long as we learn from our mistakes and course correct!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Always Be Learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re a curious bunch, and with AI transforming our workplace we encourage everyone to learn from each other, compounding our knowledge and experience to help us change an entire industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We work long, hard, and smart, building products that delight our users and drive growth. Your ability to impact Instawork is limited only by your courage and conviction, not your job description.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Instawork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instawork.com&quot;&gt;Instawork&lt;/a&gt; is the nation’s leading online labor marketplace for food services, hospitality, light industry, and logistics, connecting more than 7M skilled workers with local restaurants, hotels, warehouses, stadiums, and more. Our AI-powered platform serves thousands of businesses across more than 50 major markets in the United States and Canada. We&#39;re not just helping fill shifts, we&#39;re supporting local economies—and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instawork has been featured by CBS News, The Wall Street Journal, The Washington Post, and the Associated Press. Forbes included us on their Next Billion Dollar Startups list; RetailTech Breakthrough named us Workforce Hiring Solution of the Year for 2025; and Inc. 5000 recognized us as one of the country&#39;s top 10% fastest-growing companies two years in a row. But what matters most is our impact. We&#39;re solving real problems for real people, and we’re doing it at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team to help us build something that matters! We’re looking for superstars who want to help us shape the future of work. With hubs in San Francisco, Bangalore, and Chicago, city offices in New York and Phoenix, we&#39;re back to working together in-person five days a week because we believe the best ideas happen when great people collaborate face-to-face. We also value diverse perspectives and encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to make an impact? Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.instawork.com/about&quot;&gt;www.instawork.com/about&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.instawork.com/legal/california-personnel-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instawork is on a mission to create meaningful economic opportunities for skilled hourly professionals in communities around the globe. Our AI-powered labor marketplace helps local businesses scale, and enables global technology companies to push the frontiers of robotics and AI. Backed by world-class investors like Benchmark, Spark Capital, Craft Ventures, Greylock, Y Combinator, and others, we’re looking for exceptional talent to reimagine the way the world works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IRL (Instawork Robotics Labs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Researchers at UC Berkeley have identified a “100,000-year data gap”—the gulf between what trained AI language models and what physical robots actually have to learn from. Closing that gap is the defining infrastructure challenge of the physical AI era. IRL is Instawork’s answer to it. We deploy skilled workers into real commercial and residential environments—kitchens, warehouses, hotel floors, and homes—to capture the high-fidelity task data that the world’s leading robotics labs use to train their foundation models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instawork Robotics creates the highest-quality, highest-diversity datasets for robotics and physical AI. We work with leading robotics builders and research labs to solve one of the most important challenges in robotics: closing the data gap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a DevOps Engineer (E3), you will own the multi-cloud infrastructure, large-scale Kubernetes (k8s) deployments, CI/CD pipelines, observability, security posture, and operational reliability that power IRL&#39;s data collection, processing, and delivery workflows. This is a dedicated infrastructure and reliability engineering role focused on scaling resilient, secure, and cost-efficient systems across cloud providers—supporting a platform already processing 50+ PB of data and 600K+ hours of video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with Engineering, Security, and Operations teams to standardize infrastructure patterns, accelerate safe deployments and leverage automation. You are someone who thrives in high-scale, fast-moving environments, brings deep ownership to production operations, and solves ambiguous infrastructure challenges from first principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 5+ years of hands-on experience in DevOps, Site Reliability Engineering (SRE), or Cloud Infrastructure operating production systems at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Proven experience managing large Kubernetes (k8s) deployments at scale in production—including multi-cluster operations, node pool autoscaling, cluster upgrades, workload isolation, and hardening (Amazon EKS and Azure AKS strongly preferred).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Hands-on experience designing, provisioning, and operating multi-cloud deployments in production across multiple cloud providers (AWS and Azure strongly preferred), including cross-cloud networking, identity, and storage architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong expertise in Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, Helm, or equivalent) and declarative, reproducible environment management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Experience designing, maintaining, and securing CI/CD pipelines, container builds, and automated deployment/rollback workflows (e.g., CircleCI, GitHub Actions).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Deep understanding of cloud networking, storage, and distributed systems fundamentals—including VPC design, DNS, load balancing, ingress, object storage lifecycle, and high-throughput data infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Hands-on experience with observability and reliability engineering: metrics, structured logging, distributed tracing, alerting, and SLO/SLI management (e.g., Datadog, OpenTelemetry, CloudWatch, Prometheus/Grafana).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong cloud security and compliance foundation, including IAM/RBAC least-privilege, workload/pod identity, KMS and secrets management, network segmentation, secret/vulnerability scanning, and audit logging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Proven track record in production incident response, on-call operations, root-cause analysis, and disaster recovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong automation and scripting skills (e.g., Python, Bash, or Go) for infrastructure tooling, CI/CD automation, and operational workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Experience with cloud cost management (FinOps), capacity planning, autoscaling, right-sizing, and storage/compute optimization at multi-petabyte scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Manage, scale, upgrade, and harden large production Kubernetes (k8s) deployments across EKS and AKS—owning cluster topology, node pools, autoscaling, ingress, and workload isolation for high-throughput data and physical AI workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Design, provision, and operate resilient multi-cloud deployments and core infrastructure across AWS, Azure, and other cloud environments using Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Build, optimize, and secure CI/CD pipelines, container registries, environment provisioning, and zero-downtime deployment automation to improve deployment velocity and safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Architect and improve end-to-end observability across monitoring, logging, alerting, distributed tracing, and capacity management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Define and enforce service-level objectives (SLOs), incident response playbooks, automated remediation, and disaster recovery procedures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Implement and maintain cloud and Kubernetes security controls—including IAM/pod identity, KMS encryption, secrets management, network policies, vulnerability management, and compliance logging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Monitor and optimize infrastructure costs across cloud services, Kubernetes workloads, networking, and large-scale object storage through right-sizing, autoscaling, lifecycle policies, and capacity planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Troubleshoot complex infrastructure issues across Kubernetes, cloud networking, storage, compute, and CI/CD systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Participate in an on-call rotation and take ownership of diagnosing, mitigating, and preventing production incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Partner with application, data, and ML/robotics engineering teams to provide self-service infrastructure patterns and remove operational bottlenecks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Participate in infrastructure, Terraform, and pipeline reviews and raise the operational and security bar through clear, practical feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Own complex, ambiguous infrastructure initiatives end-to-end—from architecture and implementation through production operation—and continuously improve deployment lead time, reliability, incident recovery time (MTTR), resource utilization, and infrastructure cost per workload.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Free snacks&lt;br&gt;- Health Insurance&lt;br&gt;- Personal Insurance&lt;br&gt;- Flexible Hours&lt;br&gt;- Maternity/Paternity Leave&lt;br&gt;- Broadband Reimbursement&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Empathy, Trust &amp;amp; Candor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We put ourselves in the shoes of our colleagues and customers and don’t shy away from uncomfortable conversations, instead building trust through honest and direct feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Bias for Action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We practice high-velocity decision-making, clear-eyed that we often operate with incomplete information. Growing quickly means it’s OK to be wrong, so long as we learn from our mistakes and course correct!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Always Be Learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re a curious bunch, and with AI transforming our workplace we encourage everyone to learn from each other, compounding our knowledge and experience to help us change an entire industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We work long, hard, and smart, building products that delight our users and drive growth. Your ability to impact Instawork is limited only by your courage and conviction, not your job description.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
