&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master of Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; You have 8+ years of software engineering experience. You deeply understand distributed systems, database internals, and network constraints, and you write clean, maintainable code (coding ~80% of the time).&lt;/li&gt;
